ti-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust.\\n\\nAll-in-one wet and dry cleaning solution. Submarine™ wet roller head washes hard floors with clean water. Detects invisible dust with laser illumination. Piezo sensor measures and counts dust particles. Compact and maneuverable. Includes motorized heads and specialized tools for whole-home cleaning. Lightest cordless vacuum with 150AW of suction."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_fjkt0Sa7SyiY9jX681I9oV8W'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The Dyson V15 Detect is a powerful, intelligent cordless vacuum with 240AW suction. It features a laser that reveals invisible dust, a piezo sensor that counts dust particles, and an LCD screen that shows cleaning performance. Its multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust for a deep clean.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to buy the product Maya."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_MCmrVNiJNGXU8ap08ZYRs0p0', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "I\'d like to buy the product Maya.", "product_interest": "Dyson V15 Detect", "session_id": "1483a843"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the Dyson V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_MCmrVNiJNGXU8ap08ZYRs0p0'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'd be happy to assist you with purchasing the Dyson V15 Detect! May I have your name, please?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My name is Mukesh.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_l7k9vpINxAv1NTbgOy0UOohf', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "My name is Mukesh.", "first_name": "Mukesh", "product_interest": "Dyson V15 Detect", "session_id": "1483a843"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the Dyson V15 Detect! To g