y sealed HEPA filtration, smart app connectivity, LCD screen for real-time AQI feedback.\\n\\nDyson cordless vacuums use powerful suction for deep cleaning. Models include V12s Detect Slim Submarine (wet and dry), V15 Detect, V12 Detect Slim Absolute, V11 Absolute, and V8 Absolute. Core technologies: HEPA filtration (captures 99.99% of particles at 0.1 microns), Hyperdymium™ motor (spins at up to 125,000rpm), Digital Motorbar™ cleaner head with de-tangling technology, No loss of suction. Up to 60 minutes of fade-free power."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_CPCvgrXeK0YiFX1uO1obtwlX'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Dyson products span hair care, air purifiers, and cordless vacuums. They include advanced technologies like less heat damage for hair care, powerful air purification capturing microscopic particles, and cordless vacuums offering deep cleaning with strong suction.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you please tell me more about Dyson Dyson V15 Detect?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_fjkt0Sa7SyiY9jX681I9oV8W', 'function': {'name': 'search_dyson_knowledge', 'arguments': '{"query": "Dyson V15 Detect vacuum features"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"Dyson cordless vacuums use powerful suction for deep cleaning. Models include V12s Detect Slim Submarine (wet and dry), V15 Detect, V12 Detect Slim Absolute, V11 Absolute, and V8 Absolute. Core technologies: HEPA filtration (captures 99.99% of particles at 0.1 microns), Hyperdymium™ motor (spins at up to 125,000rpm), Digital Motorbar™ cleaner head with de-tangling technology, No loss of suction. Up to 60 minutes of fade-free power.\\n\\nDyson\'s most powerful, intelligent cordless vacuum. Suction power: 240AW. Laser Slim Fluffy™ cleaner head reveals invisible dust on hard floors. Piezo sensor continuously sizes and counts dust particles, automatically increasing suction when needed. LCD screen displays real-time scientific proof of a deep clean. Up to 60 minutes run time. Multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust.\\n\\nAll-in-one wet and dry cleaning solution. Submarine™ wet roller head washes hard floors with clean water. Detects invisible dust with laser illumination. Piezo sensor measures and counts dust particles. Compact and maneuverable. Includes motorized heads and specialized tools for whole-home cleaning. Lightest cordless vacuum with 150AW of suction."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_fjkt0Sa7SyiY9jX681I9oV8W'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The Dyson V15 Detect is a powerful, intelligent cordless vacuum with 240AW suction. It features a laser that reveals invisible dust, a piezo sensor that counts dust particles, and an LCD screen that shows cleaning performance. Its multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust for a deep clean.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to buy the product Maya."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_MCmrVNiJNGXU8ap08ZYRs0p0', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "I\'d like to buy the product Maya.", "product_interest": "Dyson V15 Detect", "session_id": "1483a843"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the Dyson V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_MCmrVNiJNGXU8ap08ZYRs0p0'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'd be happy to assist you with purchasing the Dyson V15 Detect! May I have your name, please?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My name is Mukesh.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_l7k9vpINxAv1NTbgOy0UOohf', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "My name is Mukesh.", "first_name": "Mukesh", "product_interest": "Dyson V15 Detect", "session_id": "1483a843"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the Dyson V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_l7k9vpINxAv1NTbgOy0UOohf'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Thank you, Mukesh. Could you please provide your phone number or email address so we can reach out to you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My email is test@gmail.com.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_CFGhFIRXjqiH9AJJt6iVnZr4', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "My email is test@gmail.com.", "first_name": "Mukesh", "email": "test@gmail.com", "product_interest": "Dyson V15 Detect", "session_id": "1483a843"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the Dyson V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_CFGhFIRXjqiH9AJJt6iVnZr4'}]
