tes run time. Multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust.\\n\\nAll-in-one wet and dry cleaning solution. Submarine™ wet roller head washes hard floors with clean water. Detects invisible dust with laser illumination. Piezo sensor measures and counts dust particles. Compact and maneuverable. Includes motorized heads and specialized tools for whole-home cleaning. Lightest cordless vacuum with 150AW of suction."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_ls4xFUhCq7Y3FirredyLcTrD'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Dyson offers several powerful cordless vacuums, including the V15 Detect for deep cleaning and the V12s Detect Slim Submarine, which handles both wet and dry cleaning. Each model features HEPA filtration and strong suction technology.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to buy that V15."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_R0sqfSiR69WtXyo2mMpoqdAO', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "I\'d like to buy that V15.", "product_interest": "V15 Detect", "session_id": "6a767359"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_R0sqfSiR69WtXyo2mMpoqdAO'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'd be happy to help you with your interest in the V15 Detect! Could you please share your name with me?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My name is Tuijo.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_t69hTymcoXgoTGvVHufYdhZ0', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "My name is Tuijo.", "first_name": "Tuijo", "product_interest": "V15 Detect", "session_id": "6a767359"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"Thank you, Tuijo! Could I get your phone number or email address so our team can reach you?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_t69hTymcoXgoTGvVHufYdhZ0'}]
