ation (captures 99.99% of particles at 0.1 microns), Hyperdymium™ motor (spins at up to 125,000rpm), Digital Motorbar™ cleaner head with de-tangling technology, No loss of suction. Up to 60 minutes of fade-free power.\\n\\nEngineered for multiple hair types. Uses Coanda effect to curl, shape, and hide flyaways without extreme heat. Airwrap i.d.™ multi-styler (New Ceramic pink/Rose gold, Vinca Blue/Topaz). Features Intelligent heat control, 13-blade impeller motor. Attachments: 30mm/40mm barrels, firm/soft smoothing brushes, Coanda smoothing dryer."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_mS8eQOUqU52PIwAOgiTKDy0O'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Dyson offers a range of advanced products including powerful cordless vacuums like the V15 Detect for deep cleaning, and innovative hair care tools such as the Airwrap™ multi-styler that styles hair without extreme heat. How else can I assist you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you please tell me the various vacuum cleaner products Tyson has?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_ls4xFUhCq7Y3FirredyLcTrD', 'function': {'name': 'search_dyson_knowledge', 'arguments': '{"query": "Dyson vacuum cleaner products"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"Dyson cordless vacuums use powerful suction for deep cleaning. Models include V12s Detect Slim Submarine (wet and dry), V15 Detect, V12 Detect Slim Absolute, V11 Absolute, and V8 Absolute. Core technologies: HEPA filtration (captures 99.99% of particles at 0.1 microns), Hyperdymium™ motor (spins at up to 125,000rpm), Digital Motorbar™ cleaner head with de-tangling technology, No loss of suction. Up to 60 minutes of fade-free power.\\n\\nDyson\'s most powerful, intelligent cordless vacuum. Suction power: 240AW. Laser Slim Fluffy™ cleaner head reveals invisible dust on hard floors. Piezo sensor continuously sizes and counts dust particles, automatically increasing suction when needed. LCD screen displays real-time scientific proof of a deep clean. Up to 60 minutes run time. Multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust.\\n\\nAll-in-one wet and dry cleaning solution. Submarine™ wet roller head washes hard floors with clean water. Detects invisible dust with laser illumination. Piezo sensor measures and counts dust particles. Compact and maneuverable. Includes motorized heads and specialized tools for whole-home cleaning. Lightest cordless vacuum with 150AW of suction."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_ls4xFUhCq7Y3FirredyLcTrD'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Dyson offers several powerful cordless vacuums, including the V15 Detect for deep cleaning and the V12s Detect Slim Submarine, which handles both wet and dry cleaning. Each model features HEPA filtration and strong suction technology.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to buy that V15."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_R0sqfSiR69WtXyo2mMpoqdAO', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "I\'d like to buy that V15.", "product_interest": "V15 Detect", "session_id": "6a767359"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"I\'d be happy to connect you with a Dyson specialist about the V15 Detect! To get started, may I have your name please?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_R0sqfSiR69WtXyo2mMpoqdAO'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'd be happy to help you with your interest in the V15 Detect! Could you please share your name with me?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My name is Tuijo.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_t69hTymcoXgoTGvVHufYdhZ0', 'function': {'name': 'capture_lead_interest', 'arguments': '{"intent_label": "purchase_inquiry", "user_text": "My name is Tuijo.", "first_name": "Tuijo", "product_interest": "V15 Detect", "session_id": "6a767359"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"Thank you, Tuijo! Could I get your phone number or email address so our team can reach you?"', 'tool_call_id': 'call_t69hTymcoXgoTGvVHufYdhZ0'}, {'role': 'a