, 'function': {'name': 'search_dyson_knowledge', 'arguments': '{"query": "Dyson cordless vacuum cleaner details"}'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '"Dyson cordless vacuums use powerful suction for deep cleaning. Models include V12s Detect Slim Submarine (wet and dry), V15 Detect, V12 Detect Slim Absolute, V11 Absolute, and V8 Absolute. Core technologies: HEPA filtration (captures 99.99% of particles at 0.1 microns), Hyperdymium™ motor (spins at up to 125,000rpm), Digital Motorbar™ cleaner head with de-tangling technology, No loss of suction. Up to 60 minutes of fade-free power.\\n\\nDyson\'s most powerful, intelligent cordless vacuum. Suction power: 240AW. Laser Slim Fluffy™ cleaner head reveals invisible dust on hard floors. Piezo sensor continuously sizes and counts dust particles, automatically increasing suction when needed. LCD screen displays real-time scientific proof of a deep clean. Up to 60 minutes run time. Multi-stage filtration captures 99.99% of dust.\\n\\nAll-in-one wet and dry cleaning solution. Submarine™ wet roller head washes hard floors with clean water. Detects invisible dust with laser illumination. Piezo sensor measures and counts dust particles. Compact and maneuverable. Includes motorized heads and specialized tools for whole-home cleaning. Lightest cordless vacuum with 150AW of suction."', 'tool_call_id': 'call_qd2BVbvpgtQIHYeUU9yef4QG'}]
